t .cs1-kern-right{padding-right:0.2em}.mw-parser-output .citation .mw-selflink{font-weight:inherit}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .cs1-format{font-size:95%}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .cs1-maint{color:#18911f}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .cs1-maint{color:#18911f}}</style><cite id=\"CITEREFMorris2004\" class=\"citation book\">Morris, Evan. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.google.com.tw/books/edition/From_Altoids_to_Zima/9TeOf3BcOJIC?hl=en&amp;gbpv=1&amp;dq=Mentos+1932&amp;pg=PA58&amp;printsec=frontcover\">From Altoids to Zima: The Surprising Stories Behind 125 Famous Brand Names</a>. Touchstone. 2004-11-09: 58 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2025-05-14</span>&#93;</span>. <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-74327-647-4\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-74327-647-4\"><span title=\"國際標準書號\">ISBN</span>&#160;978-0-74327-647-4</a>. <q>Mentos: First manufactured in 1932 by the Dutch candy making firm of Van Melle, this powerful, chewy mint sold in rolls is now known primarily for a series of TV spots that began in the 1990s and have alternately been described as \"bizarre\", \"brilliant\", and simply \"the world's most annoying commercials\"</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%90%AC%E6%A8%82%E7%8F%A0&amp;rft.aufirst=Evan&amp;rft.aulast=Morris&amp;rft.btitle=From+Altoids+to+Zima%3A+The+Surprising+Stories+Behind+125+Famous+Brand+Names&amp;rft.date=2004-11-09&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-74327-647-4&amp;rft.pages=58&amp;rft.pub=Touchstone&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com.tw%2Fbooks%2Fedition%2FFrom&#95;Altoids&#95;to&#95;Zima%2F9TeOf3BcOJIC%3Fhl%3Den%26gbpv%3D1%26dq%3DMentos%2B1932%26pg%3DPA58%26printsec%3Dfrontcover&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFPerfetti&#95;Van&#95;Melle2025\" class=\"citation news\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E5%87%A1%E5%B8%9D%E8%8C%83%E6%A2%85%E5%8B%92\" title=\"不凡帝范梅勒\">Perfetti Van Melle</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/mentos-brings-back-iconic-90s-freshmaker-jingle-302418698.html\">MENTOS BRINGS BACK ICONIC 90s \"FRESHMAKER\" JINGLE</a>. PR Newswire. 2025-04-02 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2025-05-14</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250722111318/https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/mentos-brings-back-iconic-90s-freshmaker-jingle-302418698.html\">存檔</a>於2025-07-22）. <q>Mentos has been ever present in culture since 1932, bringing freshness and delight with its iconic round shape gum and candy dragees in rolls and bottles. It's currently available in 160+ countries, providing refreshments to millions of consumers every day with a variety of gum, candy, and mint offerings. Mentos is a global brand of Perfetti Van Melle, a privately owned company that manufactures and distributes confectionery and chewing gum in more than 150 countries.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%90%AC%E6%A8%82%E7%8F%A0&amp;rft.atitle=MENTOS+BRINGS+BACK+ICONIC+90s+%22FRESHMAKER%22+JINGLE&amp;rft.au=Perfetti+Van+Melle&amp;rft.date=2025-04-02&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=PR+Newswire&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.prnewswire.com%2Fnews-releases%2Fmentos-brings-back-iconic-90s-freshmaker-jingle-302418698.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95310437\" /><div class=\"reflist\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%90%AC%E6%A8%82%E7%8F%A0&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://us.mentos.com/\">官方網站</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20220202212209/https://us.mentos.com/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MentosHongKong\">曼陀珠 官方的Facebook專頁</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:transparent\"><tbody><tr class=\"noresize\"><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Birthday_cake.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"小作品圖示\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Birthday_cake.jpg/40px-Birthday_cake.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Birthday_cake.jpg/60px-Birthday_cake.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"533\" /></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size:smaller\">這是一篇與<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%8B%E7%B3%95\" title=\"蛋糕\">蛋糕</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"糖果\">糖果</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A5%BC%E5%B9%B2\" title=\"餅乾\">餅類</a>等<a hre